      <p source="#source-331-351"><seg source="#source-331-351">あついあつい</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-351-374"><seg source="#source-351-374">夕食後のあつさ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-374-406"><seg source="#source-374-406">のんびりと立って見た</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-406-426"><seg source="#source-406-426">やっぱり暑い</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-426-458"><seg source="#source-426-458">むっちり蒸される様だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-458-502"><seg source="#source-458-502">ひたいには汗がこんなににじむ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-502-519"><seg source="#source-502-519">＊</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-519-542"><seg source="#source-519-542">弟よ外へ行こう</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-542-571"><seg source="#source-542-571">庭の石に腰をかけて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-571-633"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-571-613" corresp="#source-580-613"><seg source="#source-571-580">鈴懸花</seg></hi><seg source="#source-613-633">の香をかいで</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-633-674"><seg source="#source-633-674">青く澄み渡った北国の宵空に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-674-721"><seg source="#source-674-721">教えられたあの一つの星を探そう</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-721-738"><seg source="#source-721-738">＊</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-738-773"><seg source="#source-738-773">七月七日の夜も近づいた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-773-814"><seg source="#source-773-814">牽牛織女の星がどこにあるか</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-814-834"><seg source="#source-814-834">それも探そう</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-834-863"><seg source="#source-834-863">天の川流れるあたり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-863-902"><seg source="#source-863-902">天上の花のさても美しき事よ</seg></p>
    </body>
